msgid "Factor sources in this library"
msgstr ""

#: templates/carbon/methodology.html:39
msgid "active emission factors currently loaded"
msgstr ""

#: templates/carbon/methodology.html:48
msgid "Known limitations (read before external disclosure)"
msgstr ""

#: templates/carbon/methodology.html:50
msgid ""
"The Egypt grid electricity factor is an indicative estimate pending an "
"official EgyptERA/EETC published factor."
msgstr ""

#: templates/carbon/methodology.html:51
msgid ""
"The purchased-goods (Category 1) spend-based factor is a generic "
"placeholder — validate against a sector-specific dataset before using it "
"in a signed-off report."
msgstr ""

#: templates/carbon/methodology.html:52
msgid ""
"Scope 3 categories with no logged activity are simply absent from totals,"
" not assumed to be zero — check the factor library for full category "
"coverage."
msgstr ""

