#: templates/esg/methodology.html:36
msgid ""
"Unanswered indicators (and unscored pillars) are excluded from both the "
"numerator and denominator — never treated as a zero. This keeps a "
"partially completed assessment honest rather than artificially deflated, "
"which was a specific bug pattern found in the earlier consultant "
"spreadsheets whenever a row was left blank."
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:39
msgid "Why a fourth \"Regulatory\" pillar"
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Global ESG frameworks (GRI, IFRS S1/S2, TCFD) are built for listed "
"multinationals and don't weight CBE/FRA supervisory standing at all. For "
"an Egyptian PSP, AML/CFT programme maturity, licensing standing, and "
"regulatory reporting track record are as material to stakeholders as the "
"classic E/S/G pillars — so I-ESG Egypt gives them their own 15%% weight "
"rather than burying them inside Governance."
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:45
