#: templates/esg/methodology.html:51
msgid "Egypt's National Financial Inclusion Strategy"
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:55
msgid "Materiality scoring"
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:56
msgid ""
"Each topic is scored on a 1-5 scale for stakeholder importance and "
"business impact. The matrix plots importance against impact — topics in "
"the top-right are the highest reporting priorities. This does not feed "
"into the pillar scores directly; it is a separate lens used to decide "
"what to report on, per GRI 3 guidance on determining material topics."
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:59
#, python-format
msgid "Disclosure completion %%"
msgstr ""

#: templates/esg/methodology.html:60
msgid ""
"Each framework's completion percentage counts \"Complete\" items fully "
"and \"Partial\" items as half-credit: (complete + 0.5 × partial) ÷ total."
" \"Not Applicable\" items are excluded from the denominator once marked, "
"so they don't artificially suppress a framework's score."
msgstr ""

